h MFA verification.\nEscalation Process\nCritical issues impacting production systems must be escalated to L2 within 30 minutes and to engineering leadership within 1 hour if unresolved.\nPassword Reset\nPasswords expire every 90 days. Password reuse of the last 5 passwords is prohibited.\nVPN Troubleshooting\nEmployees should verify MFA setup before connecting to VPN. If connection fails, restart VPN client and clear cached credentials.\nFrequently Asked Questions\nHow to reset MFA device?\nHow to request software access?\nHow to raise a priority incident?\nWhat are the SLA timelines?", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 859, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}]}, "8da9d5abd702c4aa406be52fef84ea598b458674c8ee6a4664390c91c5467dbe": {"nodes": [{"__data__": {"id_": "605c84c1-5c51-45d3-918d-9a030e31c3fd", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"filename": "62a99f164b8a43c4ada07b2305344332_enterprise_hr_policy.txt", "page_number": null, "source": "data\\uploads\\62a99f164b8a43c4ada07b2305344332_enterprise_hr_policy.txt", "tags": [], "timestamp": "2026-05-09T08:26:38.480758+00:00"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "62a99f164b8a43c4ada07b2305344332_enterprise_hr_policy.txt:0", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"filename": "62a99f164b8a43c4ada07b2305344332_enterprise_hr_policy.txt", "page_number": null, "source": "data\\uploads\\62a99f164b8a43c4ada07b2305344332_enterprise_hr_policy.txt", "tags": [], "timestamp": "2026-05-09T08:26:38.480758+00:00"}, "hash": "d93debaa7b8eef9b9b060e3006296f7706505f03efd62796c40bd2d166027f82", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "ENTERPRISE HR POLICY MANUAL\nVersion: 3.2\nDepartment: Human Resources\n\n1. INTRODUCTION\nThis policy document outlines employee leave policies, attendance guidelines,\nremote work eligibility, code of conduct, and employee benefits applicable to all\nfull-time employees of the organization.\n\n2. LEAVE POLICY\nEmployees are entitled to the following leaves annually:\n- 20 Paid Annual Leaves\n- 12 Sick Leaves\n- 5 Casual Leaves\n- 10 Public Holidays\n\nUnused paid leaves can be carried forward up to a maximum of 15 days.\n\n2.1 Sick Leave\nEmployees must notify reporting managers within 2 hours of shift start.\nMedical certificates are mandatory for leaves exceeding 3 consecutive days.\n\n2.2 Maternity and Paternity Leave\n- Maternity Leave: 26 weeks\n- Paternity Leave: 15 working days\n\n3. REMOTE WORK POLICY\nEmployees are eligible for hybrid work after completion of probation period.\nRemote work requests must be approved through the HRMS portal.\n\n4. ATTENDANCE POLICY\nOffice working hours:\n9:00 AM to 6:00 PM IST\n\nEmployees arriving later than 9:30 AM more than 3 times in a month may receive attendance warnings.\n\n5. CODE OF CONDUCT\nEmployees must:\n- Maintain professionalism\n- Protect confidential company information\n- Avoid workplace harassment\n- Follow cybersecurity guidelines\n\n6. PERFORMANCE REVIEW\nPerformance evaluations occur twice annually:\n- Mid-Year Review\n- Annual Review\n\nRatings:\n- Outstanding\n- Exceeds Expectations\n- Meets Expectations\n- Needs Improvement\n\n7. EMPLOYEE BENEFITS\nBenefits include:\n- Health insurance\n- Life insurance\n- Learning reimbursement\n- Internet allowance for remote workers\n\n8. ESCALATION MATRIX\nHR Helpdesk: hr-support@company.com\nL2 Escalation: hr-manager@company.com", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 1, "end_char_idx": 1702, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}]}, "2f613d516cf4483c8556026cd00c9542cf79ce4090c2d36244c87a7e7552b7c0": {"nodes": [{"__data__": {"id_": "605c84c1-5c51-45d3-918d-9a030e31c3fd", "embedding": [-0.023985454812645912, -0.02164975367486477, 0.016723273321