- Maternity Leave: 26 weeks\n- Paternity Leave: 15 working days\n\n3. REMOTE WORK POLICY\nEmployees are eligible for hybrid work after completion of probation period.\nRemote work requests must be approved through the HRMS portal.\n\n4. ATTENDANCE POLICY\nOffice working hours:\n9:00 AM to 6:00 PM IST\n\nEmployees arriving later than 9:30 AM more than 3 times in a month may receive attendance warnings.\n\n5. CODE OF CONDUCT\nEmployees must:\n- Maintain professionalism\n- Protect confidential company information\n- Avoid workplace harassment\n- Follow cybersecurity guidelines\n\n6. PERFORMANCE REVIEW\nPerformance evaluations occur twice annually:\n- Mid-Year Review\n- Annual Review\n\nRatings:\n- Outstanding\n- Exceeds Expectations\n- Meets Expectations\n- Needs Improvement\n\n7. EMPLOYEE BENEFITS\nBenefits include:\n- Health insurance\n- Life insurance\n- Learning reimbursement\n- Internet allowance for remote workers\n\n8. ESCALATION MATRIX\nHR Helpdesk: hr-support@company.com\nL2 Escalation: hr-manager@company.com", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 1, "end_char_idx": 1702, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}]}}}